AddType application/x-httpd-php .inc

Options +FollowSymLinks
RewriteEngine on
RewriteBase /
RewriteRule topfive_(.*)\.html$ /topfive\.html?id=$1
RewriteRule review_(.*)\.html$ /review\.html?id=$1
RewriteRule other_(.*)\.html$ /other\.html?id=$1
RewriteRule about_(.*)\.html$ /about\.html?id=$1
RewriteRule chickflick_(.*)\.html$ /chickflick\.html?id=$1

ErrorDocument 401 http://topfivemovies.gkline.com/
ErrorDocument 404 http://topfivemovies.gkline.com/
ErrorDocument 500 http://topfivemovies.gkline.com/
















AddHandler AddHandlerphp5-script html htm inc
AddHandler application/x-httpd-php html
AddHandler application/x-httpd-php5 html
